  "name": "Multi-Agent Research Pipeline with Web Search, Synthesis and Confidence Scoring",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "e362c90c-f3de-4f85-81a6-f0239ad0a93a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -16,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Untitled workflow\n\n### How it works\n\nThe workflow processes research requests via a webhook, decomposes them into sub-questions, performs parallel web searches, synthesizes results using AI agents, and generates a confidence-scored report. \nIt then notifies stakeholders on Slack based on confidence levels and stores the research run in a database.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure a webhook endpoint to trigger this workflow.\n- [ ] Set up credentials for SerpAPI and add the API key to the 'Workflow Configuration' node.\n- [ ] Configure credentials for Google Docs and Slack integrations in their respective nodes.\n- [ ] Set up PostgreSQL database credentials in the 'Store Research Run' node.\n- [ ] Define the confidence threshold value in the 'Workflow Configuration' node.\n- [ ] Configure the Slack channel name(s) in the 'Workflow Configuration' node.\n\n### Customization\n\nCustomize the AI agent prompts in the Planner Agent, Synthesis Agent, and Confidence Scorer nodes to align with specific research requirements or tone preferences. Adjust the Google Doc report template for branding or structural changes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "83d4fa80-f4de-4b6a-a568-494e5fc855c7",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        544,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Webhook and workflow setup\n\nHandles the initial webhook trigger and configuration of workflow parameters like API keys, confidence threshold, and Slack channel."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c74f677b-ca9d-49e1-872a-321aa47cd2d7",
